	"notes": [
		"CC 7/9/10 are mixer-level controls on all 16 tracks.",
		"CC 12-15 (Param 1-4) address engine-specific parameters on synth tracks and do different things on aux tracks.",
		"CC 20-39 apply to synth tracks (T1-T8) except where the aux table lists them.",
		"CC 40-41 (LFO) exist on every track, but their meaning depends on the track and LFO type.",
		"On T11 (External MIDI), CC 32-39 control outbound MIDI CC routing, not synthesis.",
		"Pitch bend, channel aftertouch and mod wheel (CC1) are not in this table. In .xy files they are recorded as performance keyframe lanes after each pattern's note vector, not as p-locks.",
		"CC9 (mute) never produced p-lock data in the hold-record captures (unnamed 124, T4). Mute is stored in scene rows.",
		"The 'sample_multisample' column in the upstream instrument table is sparse. Its CC40/41 entries look like LFO-type-dependent labels rather than sampler-specific ones, so treat that column as unverified."
	],
